# Backend Shell Scripts

Required header on every script:

```bash
#!/usr/bin/env bash
if [ -z "${BASH_VERSION:-}" ]; then exec bash "$0" "$@"; fi
set -euo pipefail
```

| Script | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `start.sh` / `stop.sh` | Flask API via Gunicorn (`gunicorn.conf.py`, port 5000) |
| `worker.sh` / `stop_worker.sh` | Background ETL worker |
| `bootstrap.sh` | POST `/api/admin/bootstrap` — exit 1 on HTTP 4xx/5xx |
| `refresh_data.sh` | Fundamentals + prices + insiders + feeds |
| `scripts/capabilities.sh` | Config reference, feature flags (`enable`/`disable`/`env`) |

Logs: `backend.out`, `worker.out`. PID files: `.backend.pid`, `.worker.pid`.
